sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-19-petroff-kahng-second-assessor-audit-petroff-stromatolite-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Petroff et al. (2010) Conical Stromatolite Spacing Law & Dome-to-Cone Morphospace — Model fidelity to source: 30/100" ;
        rdfs:comment "Spacing law diffusion_length (L64-67) is the correct form, but alpha and tau are free knobs set by the script (alpha_field = 1.0 at L179, alpha_lab = 0.30 at L180 described as a least-squares fit with no data or fit in the file), and the text panel states that 0.66 cm records a ~20 h rhythmic metabolism (L238-239) whereas 0.66 cm was computed at tau = 12 h (L193, L207; tau = 20 h gives 0.85 cm). Panels (d-f) and the GIF do not implement Petroff's diffusion-limited growth: they credit Batchelor et al. 2004 (L31-34, L86-98), modify it with an unsourced quadratic crest weight w_photic = 0.12 + 0.88*(z/z_max)^2 (L126-130) and 3-point smoothing (L141-142), and never integrate the docstring's own KPZ equation dh/dt = v + lambda*(1 + 1/2 (dh/dr)^2) (L34, L85, L296). Evidence: 2010-petroff-stromatolite.py L64–L67: diffusion_length ell = alpha*sqrt(D*tau) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5564750/2010-petroff-stromatolite.py#L64-L67>; 2010-petroff-stromatolite.py L126–L142: ad-hoc w_photic = 0.12 + 0.88*(z/z_max)^2, pinned basal feet, and 3-point Laplacian smoothing <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5564750/2010-petroff-stromatolite.py#L126-L142>; 2010-petroff-stromatolite.py L193–L240: computes ell = 0.66 cm at tau = 12 h while text panel claims ~20 h rhythmic metabolism <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5564750/2010-petroff-stromatolite.py#L193-L240>." ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-petroff-stromatolite-model-fidelity> ;
        pk:hasProbability "0.3"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "unfaithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-petroff-stromatolite-model-fidelity> rdfs:label "Petroff et al. (2010) Conical Stromatolite Spacing Law & Dome-to-Cone Morphospace (2010-petroff-stromatolite.py, docs/media/petroff_stromatolite_dome_to_cone.gif) satisfies the MorphoEval 0.1.0 criterion 'Model fidelity to source' for Photosynthetic microbial mats and conical stromatolites (Conophyton / Yellowstone modern mats)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Claude Fable 5.1 (Cursor subagent e65a3d81-92b5-4bb2-941f-4566032cb3cd, blinded second assessor)" .
}

